# The sdist ships only the installable package. Tests rely on repo-local
# fixtures (e.g. the mock statsmodels package) and are run from the GitHub
# checkout, so shipping a partial tests/ tree would give sdist users a
# broken suite. distutils' legacy defaults would otherwise auto-include
# tests/test*.py without the fixture subdirectories.
prune tests
prune validation
include CHANGELOG.md
